{"id":"n69354-1-9","stage":3,"title":"우연히 · 偶然地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69354-1-9-1","ko":"내가 어제 동생이랑 영화 보러 간 걸 어떻게 알았어?","zh":"你怎么知道我昨天和弟弟或妹妹一起去看电影了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"동생이랑","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생이랑","audio":"/audio/dab88134e262ec7fd91c.mp3"}},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}},{"text":"보러","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보러","audio":"/audio/d5e8ae6946132d84eb67.mp3"}},{"text":"간","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간","audio":"/audio/74ca8db3a8d704900080.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"걸 是 것을 的口语缩略；것 表示前面所述的行为或情况，을 标记宾语。这里不是指示代词“那个”，也不是句末感叹语尾。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"알았어?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4748866797644d039104.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69354-1-9-2","ko":"나도 영화관에 갔다가 우연히 너희를 봤어.","zh":"我也去了电影院，碰巧看见了你们。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"영화관에","meaning":"电影院","explanation":"영화관：电影院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"영화관","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14113","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화관에","audio":"/audio/1d7a8f7f15e66dcfe0de.mp3"}},{"text":"갔다가","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔다가","audio":"/audio/87ea69e93c0d478e4c4d.mp3"}},{"text":"우연히","meaning":"偶然地","explanation":"우연히：偶然地。","readings":[{"term":"우연히","audio":"/audio/2fedb372fa042b7e742b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69354","senseId":"1","lemma":"우연히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우연히","audio":"/audio/2fedb372fa042b7e742b.mp3"}},{"text":"너희를","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희를","audio":"/audio/4299dfb72c8838715765.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어.","meaning":"见，碰头","explanation":"보다：见，碰头；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어","audio":"/audio/0d4b5b0b4b8a9c03faf0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"92cd07820110f1fb","term":"영화관","zh":"电影院","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3","entryId":"14113","definition":"配备放映电影的设施，并能够使公众欣赏电影的地方。","pronunciation":["영화관"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"2fedb372fa042b7e","term":"우연히","zh":"偶然地","audio":"/audio/2fedb372fa042b7e742b.mp3","entryId":"69354","definition":"某事意外而自然实现地。","pronunciation":["우연히"]},{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"见，碰头","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"以某种目的而见人。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3733d9850206c5526c7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.028,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69354","label